<main>
  <section style="padding:5rem 0; background:var(--paper-2);">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1 style="font-size:3rem; text-align:center;">Our Services</h1>
      <p style="text-align:center; font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:65ch; margin:1rem auto;">Personalised home tutoring for every class, board and competitive exam.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding:4rem 0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cats">
        <article class="cat reveal">
          <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 6.5 12 3l9 3.5-9 3.5-9-3.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M6 9v5c0 1.2 2.7 2.5 6 2.5s6-1.3 6-2.5V9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="M21 6.5V12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
          <span class="tag">All Boards</span>
          <h3>Every Board We Cover</h3>
          <p>State Board, CBSE, ICSE, ISC, IGCSE and IB. Whichever syllabus your school follows, we match the right tutor.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="cat reveal">
          <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 5h16v14H4zM4 9h16M9 5v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/></svg></span>
          <span class="tag">Middle School</span>
          <h3>Class V to VIII</h3>
          <p>Subject-specialist tutors for Science, Maths, Social Studies and English as concepts get more advanced.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="cat reveal">
          <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
          <span class="tag">Board Exams</span>
          <h3>Class IX & X Board Prep</h3>
          <p>Board exam preparation across all boards, with chapter tests, practice papers and exam strategy.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="cat reveal">
          <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 4 2 9l10 5 8-4v6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M6 11.5V16c0 1.3 2.7 2.5 6 2.5s6-1.2 6-2.5v-4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/></svg></span>
          <span class="tag">Senior Secondary</span>
          <h3>Class XI & XII</h3>
          <p>Science (PCM/PCB), Commerce and Humanities streams, from theory mastery to internal assessments.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="cat reveal">
          <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="m12 3 2.5 5.3L20 9l-4 4 1 6-5-2.8L7 19l1-6-4-4 5.5-.7z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
          <span class="tag">Entrance Prep</span>
          <h3>Competitive Exams</h3>
          <p>NEET, JEE and MHCET foundation and preparation, handled by subject specialists with proven results.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="cat reveal">
          <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm0 3c1.66 0 3 1.34 3 3s-1.34 3-3 3-3-1.34-3-3 1.34-3 3-3zm0 14.2c-2.5 0-4.71-1.28-6-3.22.03-1.99 4-3.08 6-3.08 1.99 0 5.97 1.09 6 3.08-1.29 1.94-3.5 3.22-6 3.22z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>
          <span class="tag">Personal</span>
          <h3>One-on-One Tuition</h3>
          <p>Fully personalised teaching at your home, scheduled around your family's convenient times.</p>
        </article>
